{"availability":"available","full":"zqc3117/Spotter","name":"Spotter","description":"Official codebase for Spotter: Let the Embodied Model Lead, and the VLM Reflect for It","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":197,"forks":24,"created":"2026-09-29T04:58:07Z","updated":"2026-10-13T00:39:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","topics":["embodied-ai","llm-agent","qwen","robocasa","robodojo","robot-learning","robot-manipulation","robotics","robotwin","runtime-monitoring-system","vlm-agent"],"demo":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:30.150Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:30.150Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:30.150Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","stars":165,"forks":21},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:30.150Z","stars":197,"forks":24}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["If our project helps you, please give us a star ⭐ on GitHub to support us.","Spotter adds a lightweight intervention layer between a frozen embodied model (System 1) and a VLM (System 2). Instead of having the VLM plan every step, the embodied model leads and keeps executing, while a local screener watches in parallel and the VLM steps in only to confirm and repair an error. The VLM's job becomes much simpler, so the whole framework works with a locally served, open-source Qwen and no privileged information.","Existing VLM-led robot agents are serial: the VLM plans a segment, the embodied model executes it, and the VLM decides what comes next. This forces a dilemma:"],"features":["A lightweight intervention layer. Like a person who keeps a little attention on a task and focuses only when","something looks wrong, Spotter lets execution flow continuously and brings in the VLM only on a confirmed error.","A simpler job for the VLM. The VLM no longer drives the robot. It only has to notice a failure, repair it with","a short primitive plan, and check the fix. A local Qwen with no access to the task's success signal is enough.","Continuous execution, low overhead. The embodied model never waits for the VLM on the routine path:"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"If our project helps you, please give us a star ⭐ on GitHub to support us.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.772Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T09:27:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zqc3117/Spotter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.773Z","hash":"639f43effbe68be31d8149441f0dc65d193fd00d6215f0ba74da181d374b26fc","originalBytes":24839,"storedBytes":24839,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:54.677Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"llm agent"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Simulation & physics"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T03:19:00.458Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T03:19:00.458Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T03:19:00.458Z","target":"https://zqc3117.github.io/Spotter/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-24T03:19:00.458Z